  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">The Point of Philosophy (2016), published by Peter Lang Verlag, has been cited 1 time.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">The Point of Philosophy by Ludo Abicht and Hendrik Opdebeeck was published by Peter Lang Verlag in 2016. It is part of the Philosophie et Politique / Philosophy and Politics series. Conceptually, the work connects to Point (geometry), Philosophy, Epistemology, Mathematics and Geometry.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 1 citation.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It is recorded in 4 library collections.</p>",
